    "Source": "\/*\r\n    Author or source: antoinec <antoine.champion+dsp@outlook.fr>\r\n*\/\r\n\r\n\/* 1st order IIR lowpass filter (6db\/octave slope) \r\n *\r\n * Obtained from a 1st order RC circuit transfer\r\n * function with bilinear transformation and \r\n * frequency warping *\/\r\n\r\nfloat prevOutput = 0;\r\nfloat prevInput = 0;\r\n\r\nformula_main \r\n{\r\n    float frequency = exp(2.3 + KNOB_1 * 7.6);\r\n    float w = tanf(M_PI * frequency \/ SAMPLE_RATE);\r\n\r\n    float a0 = w + 1, a1 = w - 1, b0 = w, b1 = w;\r\n\r\n    float output = b0 * input + b1 * prevInput - a1 * prevOutput;\r\n    output \/= a0;\r\n    \r\n    prevOutput = output;\r\n    prevInput = input;\r\n\r\n    return output;\r\n}",
